# Shipped with OpenXS - Composer/Packagist vendor prefixes auto-trusted
# for checksum-based suppression (composer_trust.py), no reputation-API
# lookup needed. Packagist itself does zero review (pure auto-indexing
# from any GitHub repo, unlike wordpress.org/drupal.org's actual
# directory review) - this list exists so well-known ecosystems don't
# pay a Packagist API round-trip on every scan, not as the main defense
# (that's the age/downloads reputation check for everything else).
# One prefix per line, "vendor/*" or "vendor/exact-package". # comments
# and blank lines ignored.
symfony/*
guzzlehttp/*
doctrine/*
psr/*
monolog/monolog
phpunit/phpunit
composer/*
mrpc/*
pramnoshosting/*

